", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ningenzoo/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec798a92/uploads/origins/5a3ca470-1623-40ad-9885-0ec09c5b3bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=675fb9be105acd9137a695126f275eba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ec798a92/uploads/origins/5a3ca470-1623-40ad-9885-0ec09c5b3bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=675fb9be105acd9137a695126f275eba, https://si.imgix.net/ec798a92/uploads/origins/5a3ca470-1623-40ad-9885-0ec09c5b3bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6ea7eea1f31b6da8cb0173acba7cd10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ec798a92/uploads/origins/5a3ca470-1623-40ad-9885-0ec09c5b3bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aea851a8864f27828a1824b3acb5fedd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "綺麗な画風ですねー。\n私のオリジナルキャラクター「ラムジウ」を描いていただけないでしょうか。\n青竜（せいりゅう）魔道士。  風属性の魔法を得意とする。\n\nhttp://ramz.zenutech.com/ramzryu/ref_jamsheets/ramzyuu_mage_jp.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ningenzoo/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/229ce9cb/uploads/origins/cccaa1b3-68cd-461e-82fa-8eb2a5bbc468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c226d93f321dfe06a7987a7d0d9cb39b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/229ce9cb/uploads/origins/cccaa1b3-68cd-461e-82fa-8eb2a5bbc468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c226d93f321dfe06a7987a7d0d9cb39b, https://si.imgix.net/229ce9cb/uploads/origins/cccaa1b3-68cd-461e-82fa-8eb2a5bbc468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6db24123351ec1a69bc83aaebbe263aa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/229ce9cb/uploads/origins/cccaa1b3-68cd-461e-82fa-8eb2a5bbc468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cfb6578f93089f7996936f7dc7cd36c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": f